WEBVTT

00:18:29.329 --> 00:18:32.413
but it is fundamentally about this
tension between, you know,

00:18:32.454 --> 00:18:35.079
the black community wanting to
sort of shutter itself off

00:18:35.246 --> 00:18:40.329
and sort of integrate into the world
despite the tortures that the rest of

00:18:40.329 --> 00:18:42.371
the world has put us through. Right.

00:18:42.413 --> 00:18:46.121
As Martin versus Malcolm and literally
the climactic fight scene happens on

00:18:46.121 --> 00:18:47.913
a literal underground railroad.

00:18:48.246 --> 00:18:52.746
There's a tendency for a lot of people
to sort of tut tut about, you know,

00:18:52.746 --> 00:18:55.621
these big studio action movies and
act like they're somehow like

00:18:56.454 --> 00:18:59.829
a diminution of the art form. And I just
have never believe that that's true.